{
  "name": "Registro de Muestras Geológicas - Alta Guajira",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Cómo dejar esto funcionando\n\n1. **Webhook**: revisa que el método sea POST. Copia la *Production URL* (no la de test) y ponla en `config.createWebhook` de tu `app.js`. Activa el workflow con el interruptor arriba a la derecha.\n2. **PostgreSQL**: conecta tus credenciales y confirma que exista la tabla `samples` con las columnas usadas abajo.\n3. **Google Sheets**: conecta tus credenciales y reemplaza el `documentId` por el ID real de tu hoja (está en la URL de Google Sheets).\n4. **Gmail**: conecta tus credenciales y reemplaza los correos de `sendTo` por los reales (laboratorio, coordinador, director).\n5. Los dos nodos **Responder...** ya traen el header `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` para que el navegador no bloquee la respuesta por CORS.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "sticky-notas",
      "name": "Notas de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "26c27d4a-16a3-4fb5-a7fc-660d426ac7b0",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-200, 0],
      "webhookId": "26c27d4a-16a3-4fb5-a7fc-660d426ac7b0"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "1", "name": "sample_code", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.codigo }}" },
            { "id": "2", "name": "date", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.fecha }}" },
            { "id": "3", "name": "geologist", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.geologo }}" },
            { "id": "4", "name": "latitude", "type": "number", "value": "={{ Number($json.latitud) }}" },
            { "id": "5", "name": "longitude", "type": "number", "value": "={{ Number($json.longitud) }}" },
            { "id": "6", "name": "municipality", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.municipio }}" },
            { "id": "7", "name": "sample_type", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.tipo }}" },
            { "id": "8", "name": "lithology", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.litologia }}" },
            { "id": "9", "name": "priority", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.prioridad }}" },
            { "id": "10", "name": "observations", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.observaciones }}" },
            {
              "id": "11",
              "name": "laboratory",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.tipo === 'Roca' ? 'Laboratorio Petrográfico' : $json.tipo === 'Suelo' ? 'Laboratorio Geoquímico' : $json.tipo === 'Sedimento' ? 'Laboratorio Geoquímico' : $json.tipo === 'Agua' ? 'Laboratorio Hidroquímico' : $json.tipo === 'Gas del suelo' ? 'Laboratorio de Gases' : 'Por definir' }}"
            },
            { "id": "12", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "Pendiente" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-edit-fields",
      "name": "Edit Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [20, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "schema": { "__rl": true, "value": "public", "mode": "list" },
        "table": { "__rl": true, "value": "samples", "mode": "list" },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "sample_code": "={{ $json.sample_code }}",
            "date": "={{ $json.date }}",
            "geologist": "={{ $json.geologist }}",
            "municipality": "={{ $json.municipality }}",
            "latitude": "={{ $json.latitude }}",
            "longitude": "={{ $json.longitude }}",
            "sample_type": "={{ $json.sample_type }}",
            "lithology": "={{ $json.lithology }}",
            "priority": "={{ $json.priority }}",
            "laboratory": "={{ $json.laboratory }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.status }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-postgres",
      "name": "Guardar en PostgreSQL",
